From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:11:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] BlueOS: Launcher3: 0.8 label colours, title marquee,
 live weather icon in place, notes over the album art, icon plates exactly
 like the widgets
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Label colour roles (by the wallpaper / white / pill); a cut track title runs as a marquee overlay; the live weather icon is laid out by hand (it stayed 0x0 after a theme switch) and follows the widget's tint; the rising notes start from the album art too (they showed only over the placeholder); «Точно как у виджетов»: the wallpaper blurred under home screen icon plates; the Arona widget shows her own name and «За партой».

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I040f7a357d0eed5b064cad4958b7f025c954a8d9
